        "Gurkha His Majesty’s Reserve (HMR) — Connecticut maduro wrapper, 18-year-aged leaf and a 12-year-aged Dominican binder, said to be infused with Louis XIII cognac. $750 a cigar, $15,000 for a box of twenty; fewer than 75 boxes a year",
        "Gurkha Black Dragon — 2006. $1,150 a cigar, $115,000 a box; presented in hand-carved camel-bone chests, with only five cases produced"
