        "Selección No. 1 Poderosos — 6 × 54, debuted at the 2022 PCA, $10.40, boxes of 20. The first line made at the company’s own Fábrica de Tabacos HVC S.A.; also Short Robustos 4½ × 52 ($9.30) and Esenciales 5⅝ × 46 ($8.40)",
